name issue_15_aimd_v2_clean_link
describe 2.5 Mbps link, 25 ms one-way, no impairments, `cc v2`: libwebrtc's acked rate and AimdRateControl (#15)
# `cc v2` takes the acknowledged rate from libwebrtc's BitrateEstimator (500 ms first window, then 150 ms
# Bayesian windows) and rate control from AimdRateControl. Utilization moves from `cc v1` (78-85 %, seeds 1-5)
# to libwebrtc's 91.6 % (parity-data, 10 seeds); `cc v2` gives 90-91 %.
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=25ms queue=300ms
expect audio.interruptions == 0
expect video.freeze_count == 0
expect video.e2e_delay_p95_ms < 150
# Issue #355 (rate_utilization_tracker on by default, as libwebrtc; program.md 0.2, needs-human): was < 60. Ours 67.8
# on seed 1; libwebrtc per seed 44/86/52/53/67/138/94/47/80/89 (mean 74.9) on main's compare-webrtc, ours with the
# tracker 68/89/58/57/75/144/93/49/81/89 (mean 80.4; 82.3 without).
expect cc.queue_p95_ms < 70
expect cc.unsettled == 0
expect cc.utilization_pct >= 86
